Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Open Headers managed storage — Firefox, Windows.
; Firefox reads extension policy from a ManagedStorage native manifest:
; the registry value below points at a JSON document on disk (use the
; template in ../firefox/contact@tirzuman.com.json and adjust the path).
; HKLM works too for machine-wide deployment.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Mozilla\ManagedStorage\contact@tirzuman.com]
@="C:\\ProgramData\\OpenHeaders\\contact@tirzuman.com.json"
